# KPA EMC² Web Portal — Core AI Rules

## Mandatory Reading
Before performing any action, consult the memory files in `docs/memory/`:
- `docs/memory/overview.md`
- `docs/memory/progress.md`
- `docs/memory/gotchas.md`
- `docs/memory/rules.md`
- `docs/memory/conventions.md`

## Absolute Constraints
- **Communication:** Always use Bahasa Indonesia when explaining to the user.
- **Code Standards:** Production-ready code only. No placeholders or empty TODO stubs.
- **Database:** PostgreSQL runs on port **`5433`**. Never store raw binary in DB; use `CloudinaryService`.
- **RBAC:** Roles are `SUPER_ADMIN`, `ADMIN`, `EDITOR` via `RoleTypeEnum`. Guard admin routes with `EnsureAdmin` middleware.
- **Verification:** Run `php artisan test` and `npm run build` before committing.
